Column name: population_1_year_and_over Type: FLOAT Description: Population 1 year and over. All people, male and female, child and adult, living in a given geographic area that are 1 year and older.
Column name: income_20000_24999 Type: FLOAT Description: Households with income of $20,000 to $24,999. The number of households in a geographic area whose annual income was between $20,000 and $24,999.
