Column name: occupied_housing_units Type: FLOAT Description: Occupied housing units. A housing unit is classified as occupied if it is the usual place of residence of the person or group of people living in it at the time of enumeration.
Column name: black_male_55_64 Type: FLOAT Description: Black Men age 55 to 64
Column name: female_40_to_44 Type: FLOAT Description: Female age 40 to 44. The female population between the age of fourty years to fourty-four years within the specified area.
Column name: hispanic_male_45_54 Type: FLOAT Description: Hispanic Men age 45 to 54
Column name: no_car Type: FLOAT Description: Workers age 16 and over with no vehicle. All people in a geographic area over the age of 16 who do not own a car.
